# Build context for the `web-api` service (context: ./web-api).
#
# node_modules first: the Dockerfile copies the tree before running npm ci, so
# the host's install was shipped into the context (104 MB) for nothing.
# .env.sample second: it has no secrets, but nothing in an image should look
# like a credentials file.
node_modules
.env
.env.*

.DS_Store
.git
.vscode
.eslintrc.js
README.md
*.log
